	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13420"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=522" title="View the profile of Self Destruction">Self Destruction</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 40<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v425/Undead13/Sharingan.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Sharingan!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=522"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13420#msg13420"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13420#msg13420">Re: You know that EQ ended, right?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #12 on:</b> December 27, 2004, 05:12:05 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							In reality though, some people tend to cling on to communities for a game they have &#039;left&#039; just so they can tell people who still play how much they love their new game and how much the old one sucks now....like there was someone listening who cared...oh, other than other bitter little people.<br /><br />I hope when I eventually quit EQ, I don&#039;t stalk around the forums I visit now proclaiming the gospel of some new game of the week. EQ2 and WoW do look nice and will probably do well-ish in the long run, but it was only a few months ago the band wagons were out for City of Heros and that game is already a fading memory.<br /><br />PS. We play on Rodcet. Sure, EQ has lost a lot of people and Rodcet has too, but we were overcrowded to begin with. If anything, we could stand to lose a few more. I&#039;ve actually had the chance to kill a rare mob or two recently.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v425/Undead13/Virsig1.png" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br /><span style="font-family: arial;"><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=859121" target="_blank"><font size="4">Fateseer Virulence</font></a></span><br /><span style="font-family: times;"><font size="3"><b>the Plague 70 Prophet</b><br /></font></span>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13421"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1" title="View the profile of Kinladar">Kinladar</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Ranger Bait<br />
								Administrator<br />
								Veeshan<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/staradmin.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 14456<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/macross.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								My Avatar can beat up your avatar!<br />
								<br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/kinladar@hotmail.com" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="kinladar@hotmail.com" border="0" /></a>
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org" title="http://www.rodcetnife.org" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:truman@thewavz.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13421#msg13421"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13421#msg13421">Re: You know that EQ ended, right?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #13 on:</b> December 27, 2004, 06:43:19 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							The problem is, EQ was designed around the concepts of group encounters, and they have deliberately squelched solo play styles for years. Now with a decreasing server population, and the reduced chances of newer players via random sign ups, you have a situation when server consolidation will have to occur.<br /><br />That by iteself will scare off some more people, and reduce the chances new people will start playing, with the logic of, if the people who run the game are decreasing the number of servers due to lower populations, what kind of game are they joining?<br /><br />They will do all they can to avoid a server consolidation so they can maintain the appearance of a healthy game, and that could in and of itself be even worse.<br /><br />Alot will depend on the moves of the people at SoE, and based on past experience, I have little thought they will be able to do any thing right.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.wowrankings.com/viewb.htm?name=Kinladar&amp;s_id=38" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/sig-kinladar-wow.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br /><a href="http://www.chaoticdiscord.org" target="_blank">Chaotic Discord</a> found in {World of Warcraft}<br />Guild Leader of Fires of Time (Retired)
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13422"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=522" title="View the profile of Self Destruction">Self Destruction</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 40<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v425/Undead13/Sharingan.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								Sharingan!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=522"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13422#msg13422"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1343.msg13422#msg13422">Re: You know that EQ ended, right?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #14 on:</b> December 27, 2004, 10:19:32 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I pretty much agree with that whole post, but for the time being Rodcet still has a very healthy population (for now at least...and see no reason for that to change for a good while) so the recent slump in the game is not earth shattering at least on our server. Some servers were hurt much worse and might need a server consolodation sometime soon-ish, but RN might only need <i>guild</i> consolodation to get things back to working right.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><img src="http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v425/Undead13/Virsig1.png" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br /><span style="font-family: arial;"><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=859121" target="_blank"><font size="4">Fateseer Virulence</font></a></span><br /><span style="font-family: times;"><font size="3"><b>the Plague 70 Prophet</b><br /></font></span>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
</table>
